== Voting advice applications ==
{{See also|2024 European Parliament election#Voting advice applications}}
In France, ''candidator.fr'' allows users to find the list leader who best matches their convictions through 16 questions that position the respondent and candidates on 4 axes: environmental progressivism vs environmental conservatism, migration protectionism vs migration altruism, European federalism vs nationalism, egalitarianism vs capitalism.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Lasserre |first=Maxime |title=Candidator vous aide à bien choisir votre candidat |url=https://www.candidator.fr/ |access-date=2024-03-23 |website=Candidator |language=fr}}</ref>

